ures. Required outputs: Math-mode/feature manifest and approximation certificate bundle, accepted/failed numeric-preservation cases and P11-MATH/TARGET-FEATURE context with kernel/target/origin/certificate. Dependencies: math, lower/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/lower1-validate-lowering-inputs, legality/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/complete-profile-restrictions-and-generated-form-checks interface facts, not whole-task completion. Exact source predicates and frozen evidence: specs/requirement-reconciliation/profile-system/gap-completion.edn, mapping gpu/numeric-mode-contract; all attached contextual and negative predicates remain required. No implementation acceptance is inferred.\n\nCriterion `domain/gpu-dispatch`: Dispatch declared kernels using explicit buffer state, transfer, layout, ownership and synchronization contracts. Accepted fixture: Dispatch a declared kernel through explicit host/device buffer layout, ownership/lifetime, transfer state and synchronization contracts. Negative fixture: Reject implicit transfer, invalid lifetime/aliasing or unsynchronized device-state use. Required evidence: host adapter, launch descriptor and transfer/synchronization graphs; bind source/compiler/profile/target/provider identities, source-mapped stable diagnostics and every applicable source facet field/exception/negative condition listed for this criterion in specs/requirement-reconciliation/domain-gap-completion.edn. Dependencies consume backend-gpu, lower/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/lower2-derive-abi-and-layout outputs under their stated contracts; no whole-component completion prerequisite. Status: Open; implementation acceptance unassessed.\n\nCriterion `domain/gpu-kernel-validation`: Validate/lower GPU kernels under explicit target/features/geometry/memory-space/barrier/atomic and numeric/certificate constraints. Accepted fixture: Validate selected target/features, launch geometry, address spaces, layout, barriers/atomics and numeric/certificate mode be